<p data-start="1129" data-end="1280">This is not just bad UI.<br data-start="1153" data-end="1156">
This is <strong data-start="1164" data-end="1208">a formal model of pathological cognition</strong>‚Äîa mind <strong data-start="1216" data-end="1233">without telos</strong>, collapsing into <strong data-start="1251" data-end="1279">word-salad self-soothing</strong>.</p>
