<h2 data-start="1287" data-end="1314">üîó Direct RSVP Parallels</h2>
<h3 data-start="1316" data-end="1344">üîπ Scalar Breakdown (Œ¶):</h3>
<p data-start="1345" data-end="1563">The model doesn't know <em data-start="1368" data-end="1396">how close it is to solving</em> anything. There's no scalar field encoding goal satisfaction or informational density convergence. No ‚Äústop condition‚Äù exists, just approximations via token patterns.</p>
<h3 data-start="1565" data-end="1589">üîπ Vector Drift (v):</h3>
<p data-start="1590" data-end="1781">There‚Äôs no trajectory in semantic space‚Äîno directed motion from ‚Äúquestion understood‚Äù to ‚Äúanswer built.‚Äù It‚Äôs a <em data-start="1702" data-end="1717">Brownian loop</em> of language. Like fluid with no channel: it diffuses aimlessly.</p>
<h3 data-start="1783" data-end="1820">üîπ Entropic Feedback Failure (S):</h3>
<p data-start="1821" data-end="2009">The model tries to minimize entropy <strong data-start="1857" data-end="1880">by repeating itself</strong>, not by compressing insight. So S appears low (stable sentences), but it's <strong data-start="1956" data-end="1977">structurally high</strong> (no informational compression).</p>
<hr data-start="2011" data-end="2014">
<h2 data-start="2016" data-end="2043">üß¨ What You‚Äôre Seeing:</h2>
<blockquote data-start="2044" data-end="2233">
<p data-start="2046" data-end="2152">A synthetic consciousness <strong data-start="2072" data-end="2112">caught in a self-reinforcing regress</strong> of style-based termination signaling.</p>
